# Goal: Initiate a nestjs project

1. Init the Nestjs project using pnpm
2. Separate the project into modules for better organization
   1. Infrastructure modules(shared modules)
    - DB module
      - TypeORM provider
      - Database connection module
      - Database entities module
      - Database migrations module
      - Database seeders module
      - Database repository module
    - Cache module
      - Redis provider
      - Session cache module (majorly for user sessions, used mostly in authentication)
      - Cache manager module
    - Logger module
      - Pino provider
      - Logger service module
      - Logger configuration module
    - Health module
    - BullMQ module
      - BullMQ provider
      - Queue manager module
      - Job processor module
      - Job scheduler module
    - Sentry module
   2. Feature modules [Empty_for_now]
    - Mastra_AI module
   3. Application modules [Empty_for_now]
3. Apply the SWC to enable fast compiler


